usage: organon [-h]
               {init,put,status,report,review,retire-indicator,approve,approval-challenge,test-execution-challenge,record-test-execution,test-observation-challenge,record-test-observation,field-attestation-challenge,attest-field,challenge,resolve-challenge,gate,review-phase,phase-review-challenge,advance,trace,next-task,run,audit-lot-journal}
               ...

Evidence-linked case workflow. Results are JSON; report also supports
Markdown.

positional arguments:
  {init,put,status,report,review,retire-indicator,approve,approval-challenge,test-execution-challenge,record-test-execution,test-observation-challenge,record-test-observation,field-attestation-challenge,attest-field,challenge,resolve-challenge,gate,review-phase,phase-review-challenge,advance,trace,next-task,run,audit-lot-journal}
    init                Create a case
    put                 Add or revise a case item
    status              Read the current case state
    report              Read a case summary, next task and evidence limits
    review              Review an item
    retire-indicator    Retire a rejected unused indicator with versioned
                        replacements; no human approval
    approve             Record human approval of an item
    approval-challenge  Prepare exact bytes for offline human signing
    test-execution-challenge
                        Prepare exact bytes for offline signing of an external
                        test report
    record-test-execution
                        Record a signed external test execution report
    test-observation-challenge
                        Prepare exact bytes for offline signing of a test
                        observation receipt
    record-test-observation
                        Record a signed observation of an external test
                        execution
    field-attestation-challenge
                        Prepare case and source hashes for an assessor
                        signature
    attest-field        Record a signed assessor statement; field verdict
                        stays blocked
    challenge           Record a contradiction between items
    resolve-challenge   Resolve a recorded contradiction
    gate                Evaluate a phase gate without advancing
    review-phase        Review a phase
    phase-review-challenge
                        Prepare exact phase snapshot bytes for offline
                        reviewer signing
    advance             Advance a phase after its gate passes
    trace               Show an item's dependency trail
    next-task           Get bounded instructions for the next phase task
    run                 Apply a resumable workflow manifest until a gate needs
                        a decision
    audit-lot-journal   Audit declared incremental material records; does not
                        certify field observations

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
